# Execute a STORED solution (MTC ExecuteTaskSolution equivalent).
#
# No planning happens here: the server replays stored segment requests
# (SendTrajectory, force_cached — the validated plan or failure), applying
# each segment's scene ops in chain order first. Unknown or evicted
# solutions are rejected: send (or re-run) the task first.
#
# Two modes, like MTC executing a whole solution or one of its parts:
# - whole chain: stage_id == 0xFFFFFFFF, solution_index ranks the complete
#   solution (0 = cheapest);
# - one segment: stage_id + attempt_id address a single successful attempt,
#   which drives standalone.
string task_id
uint32 solution_index
uint32 stage_id
uint32 attempt_id

---
bool success
string error
string failed_stage_name

---
string current_stage_name   # segment currently driven (panel highlight)
uint32 segments_done
uint32 segments_total
